37826","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869880/7e604184994f5c12aff7487e17fea455d2165d24/ss_7e604184994f5c12aff7487e17fea455d2165d24.600x338.jpg?t=1773937826"}],"short_description":"Set in the world of Cultist Simulator, haunt mortals and escape divine punishment in this unique relationship and resource management game. Strike Faustian pacts, manipulate mortals, and forsake your immortal life. Developed by Common Logic via Weather Factory's Sixth History License.","steam_appid":3869880,"support_info":{"email":"to.rowan.meyer@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://www.commonlogic.co/"}